Track 3: Pato Fantasma
- Story & Context: The myth of the "Ghost Duck" solidified after the incident with the collapsed arcade ceiling, where a lone, disembodied quack persisted from the ruined depths of the mall, echoing across the silent concourse for weeks, a sound many claimed was the spirit of the machines mourning the lost potential of their circuit-powered joy. "Can you hear it, the ghost still calls your name?"
